{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1", "title": "MiSTer FPGA Documentation (fork with editorial improvements)", "home_page_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "feed_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "MiSTer FPGA is an open source project that aims to recreate various classic computers, game consoles, and arcade machines, using modern hardware.", "icon": "assets/mister_kun_bw.svg", "authors": [{"name": "Kevin Coleman"}], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/midi/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/midi/", "title": "MIDI Features", "content_html": "<p>There are multiple options for using MIDI on the MiSTer.</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/dwhinham/mt32-pi/wiki\">The mt32-pi Project</a>{target=_blank}</h2>\n<p>Dale Whinham (a...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/midi.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/nativeres/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/nativeres/", "title": "Historical Core Resolutions", "content_html": "<p>This chart shows each core's default native resolution, frequencies, and pixel clock at startup. These values are not static and are documented for reference...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/nativeres.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/addons/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/addons/", "title": "Add-on Boards", "content_html": "<figure markdown>\n  ![MiSTer FPGA Sandwich Punk Style Art by hewhoisred](img/misterpunk.png){ align=center width=\"400\" }\n  <figcaption>Artwork by Hewhoisred<...", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/addons.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "title": "FAQ", "content_html": "<p>Answers to frequently asked questions about MiSTer. If something is missing, feel free to contribute by editing this page on GitHub with the Edit (pen) icon ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/faq.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/console/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/console/", "title": "Console Cores", "content_html": "<p>This is a list of the console cores in the MiSTer GitHub repository. Boot ROM filenames and their meaning differ per core \u2014 check each core's README. (In the...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/console.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/other/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/other/", "title": "Other Cores", "content_html": "<p>This is a list of other cores in the MiSTer GitHub repository that don't fit the console or computer categories. Boot ROM filenames differ per core \u2014 check e...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/other.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/paths/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/paths/", "title": "Core Paths", "content_html": "<p>Each core looks for its games in a folder named after the core. This page lists where that folder can be, and which location is used if it exists in more tha...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/paths.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/tgfx16/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/tgfx16/", "title": "TurboGrafx-16", "content_html": "<p>The <a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/TurboGrafx16_MiSTer\">MiSTer TurboGrafx16 core</a>{target=_blank} is a TurboGrafx-16 / PC-Engine implementation. Originally ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/tgfx16.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/analogsim/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/analogsim/", "title": "Analog Simulation", "content_html": "<p><em>Article by MiSTer core developer Jegor van Opdorp (SupraDeus/jopdorp)</em></p>\n<p>Many old computers have analog parts \u2014 for example, audio boards with partly analog ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/analogsim.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/conf_str/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/conf_str/", "title": "Core Configuration String", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer provides an on-screen display (OSD) that can be toggled on and off by pressing F12 on your keyboard (or OSD button). For each core that is loaded, thi...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/conf_str.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/emu/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/emu/", "title": "emu Module Overview", "content_html": "<p>On MiSTer, the top level is inside <a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Template_MiSTer/blob/master/sys/sys_top.v\">sys/sys_top.v</a>{target=_blank}. When writing or...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/emu.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/headonsoundpcb/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/headonsoundpcb/", "title": "Head On Sound PCB Implementation", "content_html": "<p><em>Article by MiSTer core developer Jegor van Opdorp (SupraDeus/jopdorp)</em></p>\n<p>This article contains a description of how we implemented the sound PCB of the game ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/headonsoundpcb.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/hps_io/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/hps_io/", "title": "hps_io", "content_html": "<p>HPS stands for Hard Processor System \u2014 the ARM part of the MiSTer FPGA. The <code>hps_io.sv</code> file contains the <code>hps_io</code> module, which talks to the MiSTer binary o...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/hps_io.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/midi/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/midi/", "title": "MIDI\u6a5f\u80fd", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u3067 MIDI \u3092\u4f7f\u3046\u65b9\u6cd5\u306f\u8907\u6570\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/dwhinham/mt32-pi/wiki\">mt32-pi \u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8</a>{target=_blank}</h2>\n<p>Dale Whinham\uff08\u5225\u540d d0pefish\uff09\u6c0f\u304c\u4f5c\u6210\u3057\u305f mt32-pi \u306f\u3001Raspber...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/midi.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/nativeres/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/nativeres/", "title": "\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6", "content_html": "<p>\u3053\u306e\u8868\u306f\u5404\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u8d77\u52d5\u6642\u306e\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u30cd\u30a4\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6\u30fb\u5468\u6ce2\u6570\u30fb\u30d4\u30af\u30bb\u30eb\u30af\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u793a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u308c\u3089\u306e\u5024\u306f\u56fa\u5b9a\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304f\u3001\u3042\u304f\u307e\u3067\u53c2\u8003\u3068\u3057\u3066\u6587\u66f8\u5316\u3055\u308c\u305f\u3082\u306e\u3067\u3059\u3002\u304a\u4f7f\u3044\u306e\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u306e\u4e92\u63db\u6027\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u3067\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002 \u307b\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306e\u9805\u76ee\u306f 2020-2022 \u5e74\u306e\u6b74\u53f2\u7684\u306a\u6e2c\u5b9a\u5024\u3067\u3042\u308a\u3001\u73fe\u5728\u306e\u30b3\u30a2\u30d3\u30eb\u30c9\u3068\u306f\u7570\u306a\u308b\u5834\u5408\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\n...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/nativeres.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/addons/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/addons/", "title": "\u62e1\u5f35\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9", "content_html": "<figure markdown>\n  ![MiSTer FPGA Sandwich Punk Style Art by hewhoisred](img/misterpunk.png){ align=center width=\"400\" }\n  <figcaption>Artwork by Hewhoisred<...", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/addons.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/faq/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/faq/", "title": "\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u8cea\u554f", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u8cea\u554f\u3078\u306e\u56de\u7b54\u3067\u3059\u3002\u4f55\u304b\u4e0d\u8db3\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308c\u3070\u3001\u53f3\u4e0a\u306e Edit\uff08\u30da\u30f3\uff09\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3\u304b\u3089 GitHub \u4e0a\u3067\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3092\u7de8\u96c6\u3057\u3066\u8ca2\u732e\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p>\n<h2>MiSTer \u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066</h2>\n<h3>MiSTer \u306e\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u306f\u96e3\u3057\u3044\uff1f \u672c\u5f53\u306b\u3044\u3058\u304f\u308a\u56de\u3059\u306e\u304c\u597d\u304d\u306a\u6280\u8853\u8005\u5411\u3051\u306a\u306e\uff1f</h3>\n<p>\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3001\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3002\u3044\u3058...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/faq.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/console/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/console/", "title": "\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u30b3\u30a2", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer GitHub \u30ea\u30dd\u30b8\u30c8\u30ea\u30fc\u306b\u3042\u308b\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u4e00\u89a7\u3067\u3059\u3002\u30d6\u30fc\u30c8 ROM \u306e\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u540d\u3068\u610f\u5473\u306f\u30b3\u30a2\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u7570\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30b3\u30a2\u306e README \u3092\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\uff08MiSTer \u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u3067\u306f <code>boot.rom</code> \u306f <code>boot0.rom</code> \u304c\u306a\u3044\u5834\u5408\u306e\u30ec\u30ac\u30b7\u30fc\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30eb\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u306b\u904e\u304e\u